This product includes code and protocol specifications derived from the
Cindy project (https://github.com/makecindy/cindy), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. Specifically:

- `src/ownership.ts` is derived from the desktop app's ownership module
  (single-owner arbitration over SQLite).
- Device-link protocol alignment (envelope frames, WS authentication,
  push topics, invoke channel shapes) follows the `packages/device-link`
  and `packages/maker-shared` packages.
- Protocol constants (e.g. `SERVER_CAPABILITY_NOTIFY`) follow the
  `cindy-protocol` submodule of the upstream repository.
